## Conclusion

In this post, I took frequency data from the first five batches to make predictions about the popularity of the sixth batch of hymns. The statistics suggest that <hymn>Joyfully Bound (#1052)</hymn> and <hymn>Build an Ark (#1060)</hymn> would be the most popular from this batch. In reality, <hymn>Love Will Bless Our Home (#1061)</hymn> and <hymn>Lord, Accept Our Humble Fast (#1062)</hymn> were the most common. However, most of my guesses were fairly close, although they were almost all inflated by a little bit. I look forward to learning from this and making more accurate predictions for the seventh batch!
